   "texts": [
    "团队主管 Jackline Kibunja",
    "<p>团队主管，顾客关系部</p>\n<p><em>&ldquo;我看到我们与顾客以及同事之间互动的温馨场景。&rdquo;</em></p>",
    "Jackline Kibunja",
    "normal"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b3/e6/b3e6956ea286dfe341054be258cc5e26.jpg"
